        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical move from Dewas to Mandsaur take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the door‑to‑door relocation takes between 12 to 16 hours of transit time, plus loading and unloading periods. Our dedicated container trucks travel on National Highway Arterial Corridors, and we factor in scheduled breaks, tolls, and any regional restrictions to provide an accurate delivery window.</p>
